{"seq":1,"slug":"unfinished","title":"未竟与拖延","docCount":2,"url":"/c/people/leonardo-da-vinci/controversies-and-appraisal/unfinished","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"the-unfinished-works","title":"未竟的作品","url":"/c/people/leonardo-da-vinci/controversies-and-appraisal/unfinished/the-unfinished-works","wordCount":1702,"readingTime":7},{"seq":2,"slug":"procrastination-and-perfectionism","title":"拖延与完美主义","url":"/c/people/leonardo-da-vinci/controversies-and-appraisal/unfinished/procrastination-and-perfectionism","wordCount":1731,"readingTime":7}],"introMarkdown":"# 未竟与拖延\n\n达·芬奇留下大量未竟之作，这是其传奇中引人深思的一面。本章直面这一特征。\n\n第一篇文档讲述\"未竟的作品\"——他大量作品未能完成背后，那颗永不满足之心灵的奥秘。第二篇文档讲述\"拖延与完美主义\",剖析这对特质如何与他的旷世才华密不可分。\n"}